. *==============================================================
. * 03_inference_sim.do
. * 第 3 篇：少簇推断模拟，处理簇很少时聚类标准误的过度拒绝
. * 面板：31 省 × 2 组 × 6 期 × 每格 100 人，共 37 200 个观测
. * 处理省数：20、10、5、2、1；原假设为真（三重效应 = 0），名义水平 5%
. * 对照：Olden & Møen (2022) 表 B1（25 簇约 5.9%，1 簇约 82.4%）
. *==============================================================
. 
. clear all

. set more off

. 
. * 首次运行：请把下一行改为本文件夹 (03-Stata全流程) 的完整路径 (用正斜杠)
. local root "D:/doubao_project/blog-lianxh/三重差分系列/03-Stata全流程"

. 
. * ------------------------------------------------------------
. * 1. 固定面板骨架，处理身份按一次随机排序确定
. * ------------------------------------------------------------
. set obs 31
Number of observations (_N) was 0, now 31.

. gen long province = _n

. set seed 17

. gen double rank = runiform()

. sort rank

. gen long prank = _n

. sort province

. expand 2
(31 observations created)

. bysort province: gen byte group = (_n - 1)

. expand 6
(310 observations created)

. bysort province group: gen byte period = _n

. expand 100
(36,828 observations created)

. gen byte post = (period >= 4)

. 
. * 初始随机分量
. gen double pp = rnormal(0, 0.2)

. bysort province period: replace pp = pp[1]
(37014 real changes made)

. gen double ie = rnormal(0, 0.35)

. 
. * 全局暂存
. tempname pf

. postfile `pf' int ntr rep double b reject ///
>     using "`root'/data/sim_cluster.dta", replace

. 
. * ------------------------------------------------------------
. * 2. 主模拟：聚类到省，200 次重复，逐处理省数统计拒绝率
. * ------------------------------------------------------------
. foreach ntr in 20 10 5 2 1 {
  2.     gen byte treat = (prank <= `ntr')
  3.     gen byte ttt = treat * group * post
  4.     gen double y = .
  5. 
.     forvalues r = 1/200 {
  6.         quietly replace pp = rnormal(0, 0.2)
  7.         quietly bysort province period: replace pp = pp[1]
  8.         quietly replace ie = rnormal(0, 0.35)
  9.         quietly replace y = 1.0 + 0.3*group + 0.1*(period-1) ///
>                           + 0.3*treat*post + pp + ie
 10.         quietly reg y i.province i.group i.period i.province#i.group ///
>                 i.province#i.period i.group#i.period ttt, vce(cluster provinc
> e)
 11.         scalar b = _b[ttt]
 12.         scalar tstat = _b[ttt] / _se[ttt]
 13.         post `pf' (`ntr') (`r') (b) (abs(tstat) > 1.96)
 14.     }
 15.     drop treat ttt y
 16. }
(37,200 missing values generated)
(37,200 missing values generated)
(37,200 missing values generated)
(37,200 missing values generated)
(37,200 missing values generated)

. postclose `pf'

. 
. * ------------------------------------------------------------
. * 3. 野生聚类 bootstrap：对处理簇极少的情形，100 次模拟
. * ------------------------------------------------------------
. tempname pw

. postfile `pw' int ntr rep double reject ///
>     using "`root'/data/sim_wild.dta", replace

. foreach ntr in 10 5 2 1 {
  2.     gen byte treat = (prank <= `ntr')
  3.     gen byte ttt = treat * group * post
  4.     gen double y = .
  5.     forvalues r = 1/100 {
  6.         quietly replace pp = rnormal(0, 0.2)
  7.         quietly bysort province period: replace pp = pp[1]
  8.         quietly replace ie = rnormal(0, 0.35)
  9.         quietly replace y = 1.0 + 0.3*group + 0.1*(period-1) ///
>                           + 0.3*treat*post + pp + ie
 10.         quietly reg y i.province i.group i.period i.province#i.group ///
>                 i.province#i.period i.group#i.period ttt, vce(cluster provinc
> e)
 11.         quietly boottest ttt, reps(299) cluster(province) nograph
 12.         post `pw' (`ntr') (`r') (r(p) < 0.05)
 13.     }
 14.     drop treat ttt y
 15. }
(37,200 missing values generated)
(37,200 missing values generated)
(37,200 missing values generated)
(37,200 missing values generated)

. postclose `pw'

. 
. * ------------------------------------------------------------
. * 4. 多省面板上的聚合比率 DD：collapse 到省-期，SE 可正常估计
. * ------------------------------------------------------------
. gen byte treat = (prank <= 10)

. gen byte ttt = treat * group * post

. gen double y = 1.0 + 0.3*group + 0.1*(period-1) + 0.3*treat*post + pp + ie

. display _n(20) "【多省聚合比率 DD】collapse 到省-期，再 reg"




















